format 1

# Workflows for nix-codebuff (root T12). actlith v0.1.0's kinds cannot meet
# this repository's cache and bump rules (root V5, scripts §C), so every
# workflow is hand-written and listed here with its reason; `actlith check`
# holds .github/workflows/ to this list. Action pins match actlith's own.

## workflows
id|kind|systems|cache|args

## hand-written
path|reason
.github/workflows/build.yml|the `build` kind takes one package and lets cachix-action push all a job builds, the `gate` kind pushes all or reads no cache, and both refuse x86_64-darwin; only Linux codebuff and codebuff-baseline closures are pushed, from main (root V5), and x86_64-darwin is evaluated only (paradigm T19)
.github/workflows/upstream.yml|the `upstream` kind pushes a branch and opens a PR with GITHUB_TOKEN; until a bump-PR token exists (root T14) a newer release fails red with its version and nothing is pushed (scripts §C)
